						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1116.msg11383#msg11383"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1116.msg11383#msg11383">Re: What is your favorite perverted or funny surname you have seen on RN</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #34 on:</b> September 23, 2004, 08:52:59 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Ive seen a dark elf rogue with Gonnastabya Indabuttox and saw a cleric with the surname of Thepothead standing right next to me with Breaenna ZaTeevadealer.  Too bad GM&#039;s dropped dealer off my last name
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><b><span style="color: blue;"><div align="center"><i>“Dark Elves dont have a heart to break, but a quota to uphold.“</i></div></span></b><br /><span style="color: purple;">Mistress Breaenna ZaTeeva<br />66th Pallie Taunter<br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=686308" target="_blank">Novelties</a></span>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11450"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
