								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Funny, had to be a woodelf chick ages ago I ran into in Kelethin named...<br /><br />Flossin D&#039;booty, and that was back when when our favorite green halfling shovel wielding GM was giving out names.<br /><br /><br />As for cool names that fit their characters<br /><br />Sinclaire Saintgate<br />Anger Bringer<br /><br />
